id: bio-suit
name: Bio-Suit
order: 4
# (1) Read off the Trait itself, not an effect: the Plating's Apparel Bonus is worked out before any effect has run
# (gear.mjs platingBonusPerTier) - its Armor's Damage Reduction and what Survivor's Options read alike.
platingBonusPerTier: 1
description: >
  Arcosians are the toughest beings in the universe; covered in a durable hide, it takes immense punishment to keep you down.
text: >
  Bio-Suit: Arcosians are the toughest beings in the universe; covered in a durable hide, it takes immense punishment to keep you down.
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Apparel Bonus of your Plating by 1(T).
  (2)-[Triggered]: If you are hit by an Attacking Maneuver and take no Damage, gain a stack of Overwhelm.

---

# (1) The header's `platingBonusPerTier`.

# (2) Hit by an Attacking Maneuver for no Damage (moment hit-unharmed, chat.mjs): a stack of Overwhelm (Overwhelming
# Fighter's Resource, max. 4). Automatic by default; set Triggered, asked in a window there.
[triggered/hit-unharmed, effect 2]
overwhelm.stacks += 1;
